1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,160
It's come to my attention that our latest advertising campaign isn't doing well.

2
00:00:05,925 --> 00:00:12,760
In fact, sales of several of our items declined right after our newest TV commercials started airing.

3
00:00:13,525 --> 00:00:20,400
According to customer feedback, the ads are extremely unappealing and make people not want to purchase our products.

4
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:25,420
As such, I'm canceling the ad campaign and firing Walters Media.

5
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:31,300
We need to start a new media campaign to make up for the damage that has been done at once.

6
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,140
I've decided to use Pembroke Advertising.

7
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:40,980
Janet, I want you to contact the company at once and request that a representative be sent here.

8
00:00:41,810 --> 00:00:44,560
Ideally, someone should arrive tomorrow morning.
